# LF in the repository and in the working tree, on every platform. The main
# repository pins this too: a mixed checkout once cost a lint-clean but
# runtime-broken release, because a patch script matched 
 against CRLF files.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.pdf  binary

*.php diff=php
*.md  diff=markdown
